 :claim "An exactly classified finite family of rule-rewriting operators (fixed rules exist iff every cycle is even, number 2^k, and are all forced to Langton balance) shows that the algebra only bounds the dynamics: collapse, persistence, and diversity are decided by the stochastic spatial process and its schedules, and the diverse phase sits on a broad finite-size crossover, not a critical point."
